{{!--
Consent notice (theme setting consent_notice: Notice by default, Banner; default.hbs renders this unless
the setting is None). Inert in a <template>: src/js/privacy/notice.js shows it only when the page holds an
embed behind its facade (YouTube, X…) or a script the owner gated with data-consent, and the reader has not
answered yet (nor sent Global Privacy Control / Do Not Track). Not modal, it takes no focus and covers
nothing essential: « Banner », a bar across the bottom shown on arrival; « Notice », a small card in the
bottom corner shown after a little scrolling or 12 seconds.
The wording: with embeds only, it names the services of the page ({providers}) (what showing them sends is
said in each embed's facade); otherwise the kinds of services ({categories}). « Tout accepter » is a solid button (ink on light,
light on dark), « Tout refuser » an outlined button of the same size on the same row (the owner's choice:
see docs/guide-auteur.md on equal prominence); the « Cookies et confidentialité » link in the text opens the preferences panel; the close
button refuses (it says so).
--}}
<template id="consent-notice">
  <section class="consent-notice" aria-labelledby="consent-notice-title" data-consent-notice
    data-analytics="{{t "audience measurement"}}" data-embeds="{{t "embedded content"}}" data-other="{{t "other services"}}"
    data-title-embeds="{{t "Content from other sites"}}"
    data-template-embeds="{{t "This page embeds content from other sites ({providers}). Accept to show it without a click." providers="{providers}"}}">
    <div class="consent-notice__text">
      <h2 class="consent-notice__title" id="consent-notice-title" data-consent-title>{{t "Your agreement, if you wish"}}</h2>
      <p class="consent-notice__body" data-consent-body data-template="{{t "With your agreement, this site uses services that may set cookies: {categories}." categories="{categories}"}}"></p>
      <p class="consent-notice__more" data-consent-more data-template="{{t "Customise your choices or change your mind in {link}." link="{link}"}}"><button type="button" class="consent-notice__link" data-consent-customise>{{t "Cookies and privacy"}}</button></p>
    </div>
    <div class="consent-notice__actions">
      <button type="button" class="button button--s consent-refuse" data-consent-answer="false">{{t "Refuse all"}}</button>
      <button type="button" class="button button--s consent-accept" data-consent-answer="true">{{t "Accept all"}}</button>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="icon-button consent-notice__close" data-consent-answer="false" aria-label="{{t "Close and continue without accepting"}}" title="{{t "Close and continue without accepting"}}">{{> "icons/close"}}</button>
  </section>
</template>
